{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_172_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年，春，王正月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_172_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_172_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，辛酉，叔老卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_172_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"四、冬，公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾子、滕子、薛伯、杞伯、小邾子於沙隨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_172_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"五、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_172_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_172","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫公子追舒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}